  "label": "Window Cleaner Stereotype",
  "description": "The stereotype of window cleaners as diligent, hardworking individuals who are often depicted as being overly meticulous or even obsessive in their cleaning tasks. This meme plays on the idea of a window cleaner being so dedicated that they perform an absurdly large number of wipes, which is a humorous exaggeration of this stereotype.",
